BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:17th Annual Greek & Middle Eastern Festival
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260913T120000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260913T200000
UID:2608307YevXmwjNkSg1O3pGEYF-g
DESCRIPTION:A Taste of Greece & the Middle East Comes to Rohnert Park!\n\n
 Get ready for a weekend filled with **delicious food\, live music\, danci
 ng\, culture\, and community!** \n\nThe **17th Annual Greek & Middle Eas
 tern Festival** returns to Rohnert Park on **Saturday\, September 12\, a
 nd Sunday\, September 13\, 2026\, from Noon–8 PM** at **St. George Ort
 hodox Church**.\n\nCome hungry and enjoy an incredible selection of authen
 tic Greek and Middle Eastern favorites\, including **gyros\, shawarma\, f
 alafel\, hummus\, kabobs\, baklava\, knafeh\, loukoumades\, and more!** 
 😋\n\nBut there’s much more than great food!\n\n🎶 **LIVE MUSIC & E
 NTERTAINMENT** • Alan George — Live Saturday • Helios Greek Band —
  Live Sunday • Flowers of the Nile Band — Sunday\, 5–7 PM\n\n💃 *
 *Traditional music\, dancing & cultural performances** 🛍️ **Internat
 ional Marketplace & boutiques** 🎨 **Henna and family-friendly activiti
 es** 👨‍👩‍👧‍👦 **Fun for the whole family** 🚗 **FREE 
 ADMISSION & FREE PARKING**\n\nWhether you’re celebrating your Greek or M
 iddle Eastern heritage\, discovering these cultures for the first time\, o
 r simply looking for a great weekend outing\, come **EAT. DRINK. DANCE. C
 ELEBRATE!**\n\n📅 **Saturday & Sunday\, September 12–13\, 2026** ⏰
  **Noon–8 PM both days** 📍 **St. George Orthodox Church** 7311 Coll
 ege View Dr.\, Rohnert Park\, CA 94928 🎟️ **FREE ADMISSION • FREE 
 PARKING**\n\nBring your family and friends and experience a vibrant weeken
 d of **food\, music\, culture\, and community under the Sonoma County sun
 !**\n\nFor more information: 🌐 **stgeorgerp.org/festival**\n\n#StGeorg
 eFestivalRP #GreekFestival #MiddleEasternFestival #RohnertPark #SonomaCoun
 ty #GreekFood #MiddleEasternFood #LiveMusic #FamilyFun #ThingsToDoInSonoma
 County #FreeEvent
LOCATION:St. George Orthodox Church
URL:https://www.stgeorgerp.org/festival
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
