 t arts community\, bringing together local artists and art enthusiasts for
  an unforgettable weekend experience. The doors are open to artist studios
  across Santa Rosa and Fulton\, giving the public a rare opportunity to se
 e where the magic happens\, meet the artists behind the work and discover 
 unique pieces to bring home. The FREE self-guided tour showcases the diver
 sity of our artistic community - from painters and sculptors to ceramicist
 s\, photographers and mixed media artists. Whether you're a seasoned colle
 ctor or simply curious about art\, Open Studios offers something for every
 one.
LOCATION:Multiple locations. See map at http://sropenstudios.com/
