 lass projects in this all-level throwing class.  The instructor guides yo
 u through the basic steps of throwing\, shaping\, and trimming of pottery 
 on the wheel.  This class is a great opportunity for students to hone bas
 ic techniques of throwing on the wheel and expand skills in all aspects of
