SUMMARY:Barrio Hollywood
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260913T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260913T170000
UID:2605288FeLWW-U4kKkkJicdWP54g
DESCRIPTION:Produced by Teatro Alebrijes del Valle and presented in part
 nership with Shakespeare Napa Valley. Founded by NVC alumnus Andres Ag
 ustin Barrera\, Teatro Alebrijes del Valle brings professional Latino th
 eater to the Studio Theater for ten performances across two weekends. Barr
 io Hollywood runs through September 20.\n\nProducido por el Teatro Alebrij
 es del Valle y presentado en colaboración con Shakespeare Napa Valley. F
 undado por alumno de NVC\, Andres Agustin Barrera\, Teatro Alebrijes del V
 alle trae el teatro latino profesional al Studio Theater para diez present
