SUMMARY:Myth & Archetype as seen through Poetry & Astrology
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260913T000000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260913T000000
UID:260801OfxKL9nGe0-CDtpHCbIE2A
DESCRIPTION:Free event! We invite all to a fascinating afternoon with Dian
 a Badger and Brian Martens who will explore through the respective lenses 
 of astrology and poetry\, valuable insights offered by both myth and arche
 type\, for better clarity and resilience in today’s tumultuous world. Th
 is event features Author and Astrologer Diana Badger discussing her book "
 Dance of the Archetypes: How Astrology Informs our Lives and Connects Us t
 o the Earth"\, and Author/Poet/Storyteller Brian R. Martens with his book\
 , "Merlin’s Wing"\, Mythic Poems.  This event is free\, all donations gr
 atefully invited. Selected readings from each presenter\, a storytelling w
 ith Brian\, then Q&A\, book sales & signing. Refreshments for sale. OCA’
 s facilities are accessible to people with disabilities. Learn more at htt
 ps://www.occidentalcenterforthearts.org/upcoming-events/myth-archetype-as-
 seen-through-poetry-astrology
LOCATION:Occidental Center for the Arts
URL:https://www.facebook.com/events/1029518629565322/
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
