DESCRIPTION:Experience the Osmosis Meditation Garden with Its Founder on 
 Tuesday\, September 15th \n\nJoin the founder and lead gardener of Osmosis
  for a guided journey through our landmark meditation garden — an intima
 te event limited to just 12 guests. \n\nDiscover the artistry and intentio
 n behind one of Osmosis’s most beloved spaces as we explore the principl
 es of Japanese garden design: the carefully chosen plantings\, distinctive
  pruning styles\, and deliberate placement of stone. At the heart of the g
 arden lies its foundation — an ancient Zen story told entirely through s
 tone arrangements. \n\nThis is a rare opportunity to see the garden throug
 h the eyes of its creator and to understand how every element was thoughtf
 ully composed to create a sanctuary for reflection and renewal. \n\nBuy Ti
 ckets For 9/15 \n\n 
