DESCRIPTION:On Wednesday\, September 16\, at 7:30pm\, two great Americana 
 groups will converge on The Lost Church in Santa Rosa for a night of beaut
 iful music.\n\nThe Real Sarahs\, are a folk ensemble known for their stunn
 ing vocal harmonies and heartfelt songwriting. \n\nThe Two Tracks\, haili
 ng from the Bighorn Mountains of Wyoming\, have spent the last decade dev
 eloping a powerful sound rooted in "thoughtful\, literate songwriting” \
 \(Relix\\).
