BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Art Night at Great Company
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260917T173000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260917T183000
UID:260912Jh-aE-VIFk-6VNJn6m-OXQ
DESCRIPTION:Join Great Company on Thursday\, September 17th for Art Night
  at 5:30pm. Art night is a free\, non-ticketed event\, with suggested don
 ations for supplies.\n\n**Art Night** is a monthly gathering focused on c
 ommunity\, creativity\, and connection.\n\n**Monthly Creative Gathering:**
  A playful\, low-pressure space to create alongside friends and community
 .\n\n**Project:** We feature 1 new guided art project each month with a s
 hort intro and demo to get you started. We always have a library of art su
 pplies available if you’re not feeling the guided project.\n\n**Flexible
  Supplies:** Use the materials we provide for a **$5–$10 donation\\***
 \, or bring your own project to work on for free. *(\\*This is all self-f
 unded\, so we appreciate any help.)*\n\n**All Skill Levels:** No experien
 ce needed! Our roaming hosts are there to offer ideas\, tips\, and encoura
 gement—it’s about the process\, not perfection.
LOCATION:Great Company 
URL:https://montgomeryvillageca.com/event/art-night-at-great-company/
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Culinary Student Lunch Pop-UP
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260917T113000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260917T130000
UID:260911xOKq8BgU406A6pzZjWCIhA
DESCRIPTION:Our Culinary Student Pop-Up Lunch Cafe is back! There will be 
 two lunch service windows: Wednesday through Friday on September 16th-18t
 h and again 23rd-25th\, 11:30 AM to 1 PM. This tradition marks the culmina
 tion of our current adult culinary job training cohort in Petaluma\, with 
 every dish on the menu inspired and shaped by the students themselves. It'
 s a chance for our trainees to put their new skills to the test working th
 e line in a real service setting - and for you to taste what they've been 
 working on and cheer them on as they graduate into their next chapter.\n\n
 Consider treating your whole team or company to lunch those weeks - it's a
  great way to support our students while feeding your crew! There’s limi
 ted space to eat onsite\, so please plan to pick up\, take it with you\, a
 nd enjoy.\n\nHead to sonomafamilymeal.org for the full menu and option t
 o place your order online in advance.
LOCATION:Sonoma Family Meal Community Kitchen
URL:http://sonomafamilymeal.org
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Jueves Sediento – Live Música Regional Mexicana  Select a date 
 and
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260917T200000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260917T220000
UID:260911RvmNsWguVEW5xGPA80zlng
DESCRIPTION:Free live música regional mexicana every Thursday at 9 PM! Da
 nny Waralu\, beer bucket specials\, dancing\, free popcorn & no cover. 21+
 \n\nThursday nights are getting louder at Barrel Proof Lounge . Jueves Sed
 iento brings live música regional mexicana to Downtown Santa Rosa with Da
 nny Waralu \, serving up a night inspired by sierreño\, rancheras\, corri
 dos\, regional favorites\, and more . It's the perfect soundtrack for cold
  beer\, good company\, and a packed dance floor.\n\nThe music starts at 9 
 PM \, making Jueves Sediento the place to keep the night going. Stop in af
 ter dinner\, meet up with friends\, or make Barrel Proof your last stop of
  the evening.\n\nEvery Thursday  Live Music • 9:00 PM Always FREE  No 
 Cover  21+  Free Popcorn\n\nThursday Night Specials  Beer Bucket Specia
 ls  Rotating drink promotions throughout the night\n\nMusic\, dancing\, c
 old drinks\, and a room full of people ready to have a good time. That's w
 hat Thursday nights are all about.\n\nBarrel Proof Lounge 501 Mendocino Av
