 use the code earlybird11 at checkout. Offer ends September 13th.\n\nPro
 mo Codes are not applicable at the door.\n\nCodes are not case sensitiv
 e\, but must be typed as one word.\n\nRooted in Sonoma County\, singer-son
 gwriter Ross Barbieri crafts a modern\, genre-bending evolution of Ameri
 cana. His music balances warm\, inviting vocals with intricate\, dynamical
 ly woven guitar lines. Drawing inspiration from artists like Foy Vance\, M
 adison Cunningham\, and The Barr Brothers\, Barbieri’s songwriting leave
 s space for the listener—painting an unfinished picture where personal e
 xperiences fill in the gaps. He is currently in the studio recording his d
 ebut EP. @rossmakesnoise\n\nY8S is Bay Area musician Isaac Yates. Raised 
 in a musical family and sharpened behind the kit in local bands\, he write
 s from a wide well of influences — Mali blues\, ’90s grunge\, West Coa
 st underground hip-hop — and blends them into something hard to pin down
 : heavy-hitting live drums\, soulful vocals\, and fine-tuned pop productio
 n. New music monthly.\n\nhttps://www.isaacy8s.com\n\nhttps://youtube.com/@
 Y8S?si=oBj4x1yso78EhNkm\n\n@isaacy8s\n\nhttps://facebook.com/isaacsamuelya
