 s that connect one space to another and the many ways those transitions in
 fluence how we see and experience a garden.\n\n"The spaces between one gar
 den area and another are often overlooked\, yet they can be some of the mo
 st memorable parts of a landscape."\n\nPrepare to explore this beautiful b
 ook\, discuss with landscaping expert Louise Leff\, and enjoy some light r
 efreshments with us.\n\n\\- Louise Leff
