UID:260830Kc_XnGLz3U-PWcNIy0uYgQ
DESCRIPTION:**Laugh Your Pickleball Off!™** is more than a pickleball e
 vent—it's a chance to make a lasting impact—it's a celebration with a 
 purpose! Every registration\, sponsorship\, and donation helps enrich the 
 lives of children with autism\, support their families\, and create lastin
 g opportunities for growth and connection.\n\n**Two Unforgettable Days:​
 September 17 & 18\, 2026​ - Third Annual!** \n\n**The 2-day event featur
 es:**\n\n\\- Pickleball clinics with APP World #1 pro and two-time USAP Na
 tional Champion Jill Braverman\n\n\\- Play with a Pro exhibition games\n\n
 \\- All-levels pickleball Round-robin\n\n\\-Finale Comedy Show with headli
 ner Shawn Pelofsky!\n\n\\- And more! —all raising funds to support child
 ren with autism and their families.\n\nJoin us for an unforgettable night 
 of stand-up comedy featuring acclaimed comedian\, actress\, writer\, and p
 roducer Shawn Pelofsky—a Comedy Store Main Room\, Laugh Factory\, and Ho
 llywood Improv regular who performs for our troops\, with credits includin
 g *Community\, Chelsea Lately\,* and *Amazon’s Stretch It Out!* Shawn is
  also a producer on the hit show *Funny You Should Ask!*\n\nThe indoor Cha
 mpionship Court at Centerline 33 Pickleball Complex in Rohnert Park—form
 erly a movie theater—becomes the setting for a one-of-a-kind comedy show
 \, where the original theater seats still provide the best seats in the ho
 use. Because comedy belongs everywhere even on a pickleball court. \n\nWh
 ether you're a pickleball fan\, a comedy lover\, or simply looking for a u
 nique night out\, bring your friends and enjoy an evening of laughter for 
 a great cause.
LOCATION:Centerline 33
URL:https://www.crushersofcomedy.com/sept182026.html
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
