DESCRIPTION:Purpose\, Profit & Impact is a dynamic event for business owne
 rs\, entrepreneurs\, nonprofit leaders and organizations ready to grow\, s
 trengthen their impact and build for long-term success. The event is prese
 nted in partnership with the Sonoma County Economic Development Collaborat
 ive (EDC).\n\nAttendees will hear from experienced leaders\, exchange idea
 s\, discover valuable resources and explore practical strategies for susta
 inable growth\, leadership\, financial strength\, partnerships and communi
 ty impact. The event brings business and nonprofit leaders together to for
 m meaningful relationships\, develop collaborations and identify new oppor
 tunities.\n\nWhether you are growing a company\, launching a venture or le
 ading a nonprofit\, Purpose\, Profit & Impact will provide fresh ideas and
  connections to help move your organization and mission forward.\n\nFor mo
 re information\, visit www.impactlime.com.
LOCATION:Oxford Suites
URL:http://www.impactlime.com
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
