UID:260813murJp_AySEq4XbUXPs72Zg
DESCRIPTION:Lindsay Everly is a Northern California–based Americana sing
 er/songwriter whose music blends folk\, bluegrass\, and West African influ
 ences into heartfelt\, cinematic storytelling. Raised in the Wisconsin cou
 ntryside\, her first piano lessons were on a dairy farm nearby her parents
  house. She crafts songs about travel\, lost love\, and the search for bel
 onging delivered with an ethereal\, angelic voice. Everly has worked with 
 a Grammy-winning producer and her full-length Destination and EP Honest Fl
 owers have both been critically acclaimed\, earning praise for her sinceri
 ty and warmth.
LOCATION:Levendi Winery & Tasting Room
