BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Public Star Party
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260919T200000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260919T230000
UID:260514e_1TKRskvESK-MkxZTViFA
DESCRIPTION:Public Star Parties are the heart of the Robert Ferguson Obser
 vatory—your monthly invitation to experience the wonder of the night sky
  like never before. Whether you’re a lifelong astronomy enthusiast or si
 mply curious about what lies beyond our planet\, these gatherings offer so
 mething magical for everyone.Each month includes a variety of engaging ast
 ronomy presentations led by our expert docents. You’ll hear fascinating 
 stories about the cosmos and the science behind some of the objects you’
 ll soon be observing. These talks set the stage for an unforgettable night
  under the stars.Step outside into the darkness of Sugarloaf Ridge State P
 ark\, where the skies open up in breathtaking clarity. You’ll have the c
 hance to explore the universe through three of RFO’s massive telescopes\
 , each powerful enough to reveal extraordinary detail: lunar craters\, pla
 nets\, star clusters\, glowing nebulae\, distant galaxies\, and more. In a
 ddition\, a field of smaller telescopes brought and operated by dedicated 
 volunteers\, creates a dynamic\, community-powered observing experience.Ev
 ery month offers a new selection of celestial treasures\, and our friendly
 \, knowledgeable docents are excited to guide you. They’ll help you navi
 gate the night sky\, answer questions\, and point out objects that many pe
 ople never get the chance to see.Come experience the excitement\, curiosit
 y\, and shared sense of discovery that make Public Star Parties such a che
 rished RFO tradition. Free for members—and unforgettable for everyone!
LOCATION:Robert Ferguson Observatory
URL:https://www.simpletix.com/e/public-star-parties-2026-tickets-240100
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Mid-Autumn Moon Festival
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260919T183000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260919T220000
UID:260910TTscgzaLRUSDf-vdlgqxOQ
DESCRIPTION:**Vietnamese Martyrs Catholic Church Announces The Annual Mid-
 Autumn Moon Festival - Santa Rosa\, CA.** Vietnamese Martyrs Catholic Chur
 ch is thrilled to announce its upcoming Moon Festival\, a vibrant communit
 y celebration bringing neighbors together for cultural heritage\, family a
 ctivities\, and seasonal festivities.\n\nThe event will take place on **S
 aturday of 2nd week\, 09/19/2026** from **6:30PM** to **10:00PM** at **
 Vietnamese Martyrs Catholic Church\, 2652 Stony Point Rd. Santa Rosa\, CA 
 95407**. Admission to the festival is **FREE**\, and all members of the p
 ublic are warmly invited to attend.\n\nRooted in ancient harvest tradition
 s\, the Moon Festival honors community\, gratitude\, and togetherness. Att
 endees can look forward to an exciting lineup of events\, including:\n\n**
 Vietnamese food**\n\n**Cultural Music and Dance Show**\n\n**Lanterns for k
 ids**\n\n"This festival is a wonderful opportunity for our community to ga
 ther\, celebrate our shared heritage\, and welcome neighbors of all backgr
 ounds\," said **Phuong Vu**\, **Event Coordinator**. "We look forward to
  an unforgettable evening of joy\, culture\, and connection."\n\nLocal res
 idents\, families\, and media representatives are encouraged to join. For 
 more information about the schedule\, parking\, or volunteer opportunities
 \, please visit https://www.facebook.com/656931121/posts/pfbid0mihThK1QFP
 P7bUiEnmC7AXF5LVFURWWyqgz6g6yvQv7N8RHBToonPY9g2yX1XLFml/?fs=e&mibextid=wwX
 Ifr&fs=e or contact **Phuong Vu** at **7073648543** or vietcatholicsan
 tarosa@gmail.com.\n\n**Media Contact:**\n\n**Name:** Phuong Vu\n\n**Title
 :** Event Coordinator\n\n**Organization:** Vietnamese Community\n\n**Pho
 ne:** **7073648543**\n\n**Email:** vietcatholicsantarosa@gmail.com\n\n**
 Website:**https://www.facebook.com/656931121/posts/pfbid0mihThK1QFPP7bUiEn
 mC7AXF5LVFURWWyqgz6g6yvQv7N8RHBToonPY9g2yX1XLFml/?fs=e&mibextid=wwXIfr&fs=
 e
LOCATION:Vietnamese Food Festival
URL:https://www.facebook.com/656931121/posts/pfbid0mihThK1QFPP7bUiEnmC7AXF
 5LVFURWWyqgz6g6yvQv7N8RHBToonPY9g2yX1XLFml/?fs=e&mibextid=wwXIfr&fs=e
