DESCRIPTION:Join Turnbull on Saturday\, September 19th for an unforgettabl
 e evening featuring a harvest-inspired menu created by Chef Nash Cognetti 
 of Brindare Napa Valley. \n\nWe’ll begin in the garden with a progressi
 on of passed appetizers and fresh mozzarella pulled by hand at a live stat
 ion. As the sun settles over the estate\, we’ll gather for a beautifully
  plated\, multi-course dinner inspired by the season.\n\nThroughout the ev
 ening\, we’ll pour exceptional Turnbull wines—including treasured sele
 ctions from our cellar—before ending on a sweet note with dessert in the
  Gallery Garden.\n\nHarvest is when every corner of the property comes ali
 ve\, from the energy of the vineyard to the hum of the cellar. Sharing thi
 s moment with friends both familiar and new has become one of our most che
 rished traditions\, and we would love to have you at our table.\n\nBring y
 our appetite. Bring your favorite people. We'll take care of the rest.\n\n
 Please notify us of any dietary restrictions in your party as soon as poss
 ible after purchasing.\n\nThis is a 21\\+ event.\n\nRegister soon as only 
 a few seats remain.
LOCATION:Turnbull Winery
