UID:260810LXcxuNVDxEedn21wQDaMHA
DESCRIPTION:Community Crystal Bowl Sound Bath on Saturday\, September 19\n
 \nJoin Sophia Luce  for a relaxing and restorative Community Crystal Bo
 wl Sound Bath in our courtyard on Saturday September 19 at 6:00pm. \n\nT
 he event will begin with 15 minutes of gentle movement to release tension\
 , awaken the body\, and prepare for deep relaxation. Next\, participants w
 ill enjoy a 45-minute sound bath as the soothing vibrations of crystal sin
 ging bowls promote calm\, balance\, and renewal. The Sound Bath will close
  with 10–15 minutes to unwind\, connect with others. Whether you’re ne
 w to the practice or a returning participant\, this experience offers a we
 lcoming space to relax\, reset\, and leave feeling centered and refreshed.
 \n\nBring your yoga mats\, pads\, blankets for your comfort. There will be
  chairs for those who prefer to sit. \n\nSound Bath begins Promptly at 6:0
 0pm\, please arrive early to get situated in the Courtyard.
LOCATION:San Geronimo Valley Community Center
