 partnership with Sonoma Pizza Co.\, will present On Board: A Skateboard Ar
 t Auction to Benefit Forestville Skatespot — a free community gathering 
 and silent auction featuring one-of-a-kind art created on skateboard decks
 .\n\nThe event brings together 16 artists\, each of whom created a unique 
