BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Step Into the World of Vector Control: Free Family-Friendly Open H
 ouse
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260919T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260919T150000
UID:260425_-6v_22HkEimAf9CqFlSyw
DESCRIPTION:Step behind the scenes and discover how the Marin/Sonoma Mosqu
 ito and Vector Control District works year-round to protect public health.
  This free\, family-friendly event invites residents of all ages to explor
 e hands-on activities\, interactive displays\, and live demonstrations tha
 t highlight the District’s Integrated Vector Management Program.\n\nEduc
 ational displays will showcase mosquito and tick surveillance methods used
  to identify and prevent emerging threats to public health\, non-toxic rod
 ent control strategies\, and simple tips for reducing mosquito sources aro
 und the home.\n\nGuests can learn how mosquito traps work\, meet the vecto
 r control technicians who respond to service requests\, and leave with pra
 ctical\, easy-to-use information to help protect their families and neighb
 orhoods.\n\nWhether you are stopping by to learn\, ask questions\, or enjo
 y a day of discovery\, the District’s Open House offers a welcoming oppo
 rtunity to connect with the people dedicated to keeping Marin and Sonoma c
 ounties safe from mosquitoes and vector-borne diseases.
LOCATION:Marin/Sonoma Mosquito and Vector Control District
URL:https://www.msmosquito.org/step-into-the-world-of-vector-control-free-
 family-friendly-open-house
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
