DESCRIPTION:*Where unforgettable wines\, live music\, and good vibes come 
 together.*\n\n Join us every Saturday from 3–6 PM at Spicy Vines for a t
 asting room experience like no other — where top local musicians from ac
 ross the Bay Area meet our award-winning small-lot wines. From Rock & Roll
  and Blues to Jazz\, Bluegrass\, and Americana\, each weekend brings new s
 ounds and new reasons to raise a glass. \n\n**S.R. Laws**\n\nRooted in No
 rthern California and shaped by a lifetime of musical discovery\, singer-s
 ongwriter\, S.R. Laws\, crafts heartfelt songs with slow-burning passion 
 and vivid storytelling. Now based in Sonoma County\, he tours and performs
  original rock with his band\, The Heartsleeves\, drawing listeners in wit
 h melodies inspired by legends like John Hiatt\, Rodney Crowell\, and Neil
  Finn.\n\n**Details**\n\nNo cover. Walk-ins are welcome\, but this event t
 ends to fill up quickly\, so we recommend making a reservation. We are dog
  and family friendly!
