DESCRIPTION:**This 10th anniversary celebration will be bigger\, brighter\
 , and more impactful than ever!**\n\nGet ready for a night of wonder in su
 pport of rescued farmed animals on **Saturday\, September 19\, 2026** fro
 m 4:00 pm - 8:30 pm at Charlie's Acres Farm Animal Sanctuary in Sonoma\, C
 alifornia. Set in the heart of Wine Country at our serene sanctuary\, this
  event is a vital fundraiser that sustains the ongoing mission-driven work
  of Charlie's Acres. Your attendance directly supports the lifetime care o
 f our animal residents\, emergency response\, and humane education progra
 ms.\n\nWhat Awaits You:\n\n\\-Meet the rescued animal residents of Charlie
 's Acres while you enjoy cocktails from Humboldt Distillery\, local wine f
 rom Etude and Moon Hollow (Moon Mountain District)\, and live music i
 n our picnic area.\n\n\\-Take a tethered hot air balloon ride with Sonom
 a Ballooning and enjoy views of the sanctuary and surrounding area from 
 40–60 feet above the ground.\\*\n\n\\-Hop aboard the Sonoma Valley Wine
  Trolley and explore the sanctuary with a special stop to treat our resid
 ent cows to fresh hay.\n\n\\-Savor a thoughtfully prepared plant-based din
 ner that highlights the abundance of our local farms by our friends at No
 va Terra Kitchen & Creamery.\n\n\\-Bid on exclusive experiences\, unique i
 tems\, and one-of-a-kind packages.\n\n\\-An insight into the sanctuary's m
 ission directly from the passionate individuals behind our work.\n\n\\*Tet
 hered hot air balloon rides are dependent on day-of weather conditions.\
 n\nYour support transforms lives\, offering a future filled with hope and 
 kindness for both humans and animals. We look forward to sharing this even
 ing with you.\n\nTickets available at FancyFarmraiser.com
LOCATION:Charlie's Acres Farm Sanctuary
URL:https://secure.qgiv.com/for/fancyfarmraiser2026/event/fancyfarmraiser2
 6/
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:A Taste of Italy at Centennial Mountain Tasting Room
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260919T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260919T170000
UID:260430cWXo-4M6YUWWGB5miBtERg
DESCRIPTION:For wine drinkers eager to experience world-class wines made i
 n California from Italian varieties\, the Centennial Mountain Tasting Room
  is a must during any trip to Sonoma County. Located just off the plaza in
  the charming town of Healdsburg near famed restaurants\, boutiques and ga
 lleries\, the Centennial Mountain Tasting Room is a destination that invit
 es discovery. Founded by the acclaimed team that guides renowned Pinot Noi
 r and Chardonnay producer Rhys Vineyards\, Centennial Mountain was establi
 shed to explore Italian grape varieties grown on its acclaimed Centennial 
 Mountain Vineyard in the rugged mountains of Northern Sonoma County.\n\nTh
 e Centennial Mountain Vineyard Tasting features the winery’s coveted Neb
 biolo\, and the pioneering Carricante and Nerello Mascalese wines\, among 
 others. To showcase how beautifully the wines pair with food\, the winery 
 also offers a delicious Wine and Sushi Pairing from nearby Asahi Sushi\, o
 ne of Healdsburg’s most popular dining destinations.\n\nGuests can also 
 enhance their tasting experience with a curated salumi board from Journeym
 an Meat Company. This generous accompaniment features six house-made salum
 i\, crostini\, cornichons\, olives\, and a selection of local cheese that 
 serves 2 to 5 guests.
LOCATION:Centennial Mountain Tasting Room
URL:https://cmvineyard.com/visit/
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
