UID:260911vTYk1466g0KpRn51Yg8KpA
DESCRIPTION:American Heart Association training and certification in CPR\,
  AED use\, choking treatment\, and first aid for adults\, children\, and i
 nfants. First Aid includes training in the recognition and treatment of su
 dden illness\, injuries\, and environmental emergencies such as heart atta
 ck\, stroke\, allergic reactions\, EpiPen use\, bleeding control\, tourniq
 uet use\, etc. American Heart Association CPR First Aid certifications are
  issued on the same day. Learn from a top-rated\, local CPR training compa
 ny with over 1\,000 5-star reviews! Our CPR classes are fun\, engaging\, a
 nd expertly taught by professional first responders. Learn More & Enroll: 
 https://vivecpr.com/class/cpr-first-aid-certification
