DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260919T113000
UID:260831vDIm7uXNY0SuAq0buiwpUA
DESCRIPTION:Join West Wines winemaker Katarina for a unique harvest experi
 ence  Winemaker Harvest Walk & Tasting on September 6\, 12\, or 19. Meet a
 t the West Wines Tasting Room before heading into the upper vineyard\, whe
 re sweeping views of Dry Creek Valley set the scene for an intimate\, smal
 l-group experience. Guests will pick grape samples and learn how winemaker
 s determine the ideal time to harvest while field-testing sugar and pH and
  tasting grapes straight from the vine. Katarina will share insights into 
 harvest decisions and other aspects of winemaking before leading a wine ta
 sting on the vine-side patio. Groups are limited to 10 guests. Comfortable
 \, closed-toe shoes with good soles are recommended for the uneven hillsid
 e terrain. Boxed lunches and charcuterie are available for pre-order.
LOCATION:West Wines
