DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260924T125000
UID:26090299jMeKFrA0OhMBhkmBmX_A
DESCRIPTION:September 24 - Joshua Moreno examines the overlapping relation
 ship between the natural and human-made environment and highlight patterns
  and systems of efficiency that exist within them. Through installation\, 
 drawing\, and film\, he re-evaluates the everyday spaces and objects that 
 surround us\, with added attention to elemental phenomena.
