DESCRIPTION:Step into a higher class of cannabis. Elevated Sessions is an 
 intimate\, sommelier-led tasting experience featuring award winning Moon V
 alley indoor flower and curated for the true cannabis connoisseur.  \n\n
 Join us for a refined 60 minute session designed to awaken the senses. You
 r cannabis sommelier will guide you through 4 exceptional cultivars — ex
 ploring their terpene profiles\, aromas\, flavors\, and effects — while 
 you savor a drink from the natural soda bar\, curated snacks\, and palate 
 cleansers.\n\nThis is more than a tasting — it’s an immersive journey 
 through craft cannabis\, where every detail is designed to elevate your ev
 ening\, from the intimate atmosphere to the exclusive perks awaiting guest
 s.\n\nDate & Sessions\n\nDate: Friday\, September 25\, 2026\n\nONE Session
 : 6:00 PM - 9:00PM\n\nCapacity: \\(36 tickets total\\)\n\nWhat’s Include
 d\n\nEnjoy a refreshing Natural Soda – A cannabis-infused palate opener\
 n\nGuided Tasting of 4 Curated Strains –Guests enjoy exclusive cultivar 
 drop\n\nTasting Passport – Track aromas\, effects\, and personal favorit
 es\n\nCharcuterie & Palate Cleansers – Light bites designed for the sess
 ion\n\nMeet The Grower – Learn how this award-winning flower was grown\n
 \nExclusive Perks – Discounts \\+ access to limited drops\n\nTickets\n\n
 6:00 PM Tasting - $75: Includes 🌱 $50 Goodie Bag\, 4 Curated Tastings\,
  Tasting Passport\, Natural Soda Bar\, Snacks & Exclusive Deals\n\n21\\+ O
 nly | DCC \\# C12-0000420-LIC\n\nEvent Terms & Conditions\n\nThis event is
  21\\+ only. Valid government-issued ID is required for entry. By attendin
 g this event at the Mercy Wellness Lounge\, you acknowledge that photograp
 hy and video recording may take place. Images and footage may be used by M
 ercy Wellness for marketing and promotional purposes across various channe
 ls\, without compensation. Tickets are non-refundable unless otherwise sta
 ted. Event details\, timing\, or programming are subject to change.\n\nCan
 nabis consumption is limited to designated areas and must comply with all 
 applicable local and state regulations. Please consume responsibly.\n\nBy 
 entering the venue\, you agree to comply with all house rules and venue po
 licies.
