BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Insight Meditation Day of Practice: A Mini Retreat
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260925T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260925T150000
UID:260715jcgqz6uw70WehohbhB8aNw
DESCRIPTION:with Howard Cohn\n\nThis day of practicing Insight Meditation 
 \\(vipassanā\\) is an invitation to develop and strengthen our capacity f
 or mindfulness and friendliness. Practicing with a relaxed and kind attent
 ion to our present moment experience\, we are able to more easily welcome 
 all experience and reduce our reactivity. Direct experience of the present
  moment enables us to connect with ourselves more intimately\, understand 
 for ourselves what creates both suffering and happiness\, and experience t
 he freedom and ease that is our natural state.\n\nInstructions for both si
 tting and walking meditation will be offered\, along with time for questio
 ns. This day is designed both for those who haven’t yet attended a resid
 ential retreat and would like to experience a “mini retreat\,” as well
  as for those with more retreat experience who just want to reconnect with
  their practice
LOCATION:Spirit Rock Meditation Center
URL:https://spirit-rock.secure.retreat.guru/program/insight-meditation-day
 -of-practice-a-mini-retreat-hc3d26/?lang=en
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
