BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Hardly Strictly Irish Harvest Moon Concert & Potluck After-Party
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260926T170000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260926T183000
UID:2609128KaJbNz3ykyuf5O7V-TrTw
DESCRIPTION:**Hardly Strictly Irish Harvest Moon Concert & Potluck/Dance A
 fter-Party**\n\n**September 26\, 2026**\n\n**Concert 5:00-6:30 p.m.** | **
 Potluck 6:30-7:30 p.m.**\n\nEnjoy a magical evening of live traditional Ir
 ish and Americana music in a beautiful setting\, with a bit of Irish dance
 \, and a potluck after-party to celebrate the Harvest Moon!\n\n**HARDLY ST
 RICTLY IRISH** (Suzuki Cady and Jimmy Murphy) brings an uplifting\, warm\,
  and soulful energy\, and a signature blend of traditional Irish tunes and
  Appalachian\, country-folk\, and roots-Americana songs. Their rich sound 
 features the fiddle\, mandolin\, guitar\, banjo\, bodhrán\, and vocal har
 monies.\n\nShiloh Step Irish Dance of Santa Rosa will give a brief demo at
  intermission and can teach you a few ceili (group dance) steps during the
  potluck after-party. Bring a potluck dish (optional) to share after the s
 how in honor of the Harvest Moon.\n\nSt. Stephen's sanctuary is beautiful\
 , has great acoustics\, comfortable seats\, room to dance\, and easy parki
 ng. Its outdoor sacred space has a fountain and seating for enjoying your 
 potluck after the show.\n\n500 Robinson Road\, Sebastopol CA\n\nTICKETS: h
 ttps://tixfox.co/e/harvestmoon\n\nADVANCE TICKETS - GENERAL $25/$20 Senior
 s & Youth | AT THE DOOR (if not sold out) $35/$30 (doors at 4:30 p.m.)\n\n
 More info: http://suzukicady.com/tix
LOCATION:St. Stephen's Sanctuary
URL:https://tixfox.co/e/harvestmoon
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
