 usly entertaining local talent.\n\nSingers\, dancers\, comedians\, musicia
 ns\, specialty acts\, and more will take the stage and show us what they
 ’ve got. With live judges and an audience vote\, you won’t just be wa
 tching the show—you’ll be part of deciding who comes out on top.\n\nTh
 e top performer gets $500 and will be featured in upcoming Mercy Wellnes
 s email marketing. Think you've got what it takes to win?? Sign up here fo
 r a shot at performing: https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSdhFtXvM6
 Z5InoYlcBwB4LZAgHku9gZ1ASYTOZRL3FvRMeqOA/viewform?usp=header\n\nCome early
