 rites when the show starts.\n\nDate & Time\n\nDate: Saturday\, September 
 26\, 2026\n\nPre-Party: 6:00 PM\n\nTalent Show: 7:00 PM – 10:00 PM\n\n
 What to Expect\n\n🎤 Live Performances\n\nWatch local performers bring 
