  will be watching\, reacting\, and helping narrow down the competition.\n\
 n👏 Audience Vote\n\nThe crowd gets a say. Come ready to support your f
 avorite act and help decide who rises to the top.\n\n💰 Winner Gets $50
 0\n\nOne performer will leave the stage with bigger pockets and a feature 
 in upcoming Mercy Wellness email marketing.\n\n🌿 An Elevated Night Out
 \n\nEnjoy the show inside The Lounge at Mercy with good people\, great ent
 ertainment\, and even better smoke.\n\nTickets\n\n🐦 Early Bird General 
 Admission — Available Through September 4\n\nLock in early bird pricing 
 for general admission before it’s gone.\n\n🎟 General Admission\n\nEnt
 ry to Highly Talented with access to the full talent show from 6–10 PM
 .\n\nSeating is subject to availability\, so arrive early\, get comfortabl
 e\, and settle in before the performances begin.\n\nThink You’re Highly 
 Talented?\n\nWe’re still looking for performers to take the stage.\n\nAu
 dition sign-ups close September 18.\n\nContestants who sign up receive:\n\
 n✨ A goodie bag\n\n🎟 One additional General Admission ticket for a gu
 est\n\n💰 The opportunity to get $500\n\n📧 A feature in upcoming Mer
 cy Wellness email marketing if selected as the winner\n\nAudition registra
 tion and talent submission are handled separately from General Admission t
 ickets.\n\nA Talent Show With a Little Extra Spark.\n\n21\\+ Only | DCC \\
 # C12-0000420-LIC\n\nEvent Terms & Conditions\n\nThis event is 21\\+ only
 . A valid government-issued ID is required for entry.\n\nBy attending an e
 vent at The Lounge at Mercy\, you acknowledge that photography and video 
 recording may occur. Images and video captured during the event may be use
 d by Mercy Wellness for marketing and promotional purposes without compens
 ation.\n\nTickets are non-refundable unless otherwise stated. Event detail
 s\, performers\, timing\, judging\, and programming are subject to change 
 without notice.\n\nCannabis consumption is permitted only in designated ar
 eas and must comply with all applicable local and state regulations. Pleas
 e consume responsibly.\n\nBy entering the venue\, you agree to comply with
  all venue policies and house rules.
