DESCRIPTION:Ready to turn your yard into a water-wise native habitat garde
 n but don't know where to start?\n\nJoin us to gain the knowledge and conf
 idence to design a beautiful landscape that works with nature to support
  local pollinators\, provide habitat\, conserve water\, and inspires other
 s to do the same! Lauren Lum\, City of Petaluma Environmental Services Ana
 lyst\, will be leading this program.\n\n\\*If you are a Petaluma local loo
 king to get free California native plants from the City of Petaluma's Mulc
 h Madness program\, you must attend this free workshop.
LOCATION:Petaluma Regional Library
URL:https://secure.qgiv.com/for/jcwzbq/event/rightplantrightplacesept2026/
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
