DESCRIPTION:Join us for a day of shopping\, wellness\, and community at *
 *Made With Love**\, a local gift boutique and wellness fair celebrating th
 e people\, businesses\, and organizations that make Petaluma such a specia
 l place to live\, work\, and thrive.\n\nExplore a diverse collection of lo
 cal artisans\, makers\, wellness vendors\, food and beverage vendors\, han
 dmade goods\, unique gifts\, wellness products\, and community resources w
 hile connecting with friends\, neighbors\, and local business owners.\n\nW
 hether you're searching for one-of-a-kind treasures\, looking for wellness
  inspiration\, enjoying family-friendly activities\, or simply spending th
 e day supporting local businesses\, there's something for everyone to enjo
 y.\n\nEvent Highlights\n\nLocal artisans\, makers\, and small businesses\n
 \nHandmade gifts and specialty goods\n\nWellness resources\, services\, an
 d products\n\nWellness classes and demonstrations\n\nFood and beverage ven
 dors\n\nFamily-friendly activities\n\nCommunity organizations and resource
 s\n\nPrize giveaways throughout the event\n\nFree admission\n\n📍 **130
 1 Southpoint Blvd.\, Petaluma\, CA**\n\n📅 **Saturday\, September 26\, 
 2026** 🕙 **10:00 AM – 2:00 PM**\n\nCome shop local\, support small b
 usinesses\, discover wellness resources\, enjoy local food and drinks\, an
 d celebrate community—all in one place.\n\n\\--- **Interested in becomin
 g a vendor?**\n\nWe're currently accepting applications from local artisan
 s\, makers\, wellness providers\, food and beverage vendors\, and small bu
 sinesses. Vendor booths are free\, and we welcome businesses that are exci
 ted to engage with the community and help promote the event.\n\nFor vendor
  information and applications\, please contact us at marketing@petalumaden
 tal.com.
LOCATION:Petaluma Dental Group | Allume Med Spa | Luminary Education Cente
 r
URL:https://www.eventbrite.com/e/made-with-love-2026-tickets-1990825552820
 ?aff=oddtdtcreator&keep_tld=true
