 arest of them all\, Petit Verdot — plus favorites like Chardonnay and Zi
 nfandel\, all paired with Jeffrey's famous smoked brisket\, baked beans\, 
 and coleslaw.\n\n**General Admission: $45~** **Enthusiast Club Members: $2
 5 • Reserve Club Members: $20**
