 ed. We're excited to be welcoming back local nonprofit\, SwimAmerica So
 noma\, for their annual fundraising auction.  \n\nTickets are $95 per pe
 rson and include two glasses of wine. Phil Sent Me members are $75 per per
 son and include wine for the night. Food and additional glasses of wine 
