BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:RIVER + REDWOODS FILM FESTIVAL
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260927T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260927T180000
UID:260806FVRLL57DUUiqpqt2RRKF-Q
DESCRIPTION:Join us for the River & Redwoods Film Festival \\(RRFF\\)\, Se
 ptember 25-27\, at the historic Monte Rio Theater. The Festival is a 3 day
  celebration of independent films\, networking\, community\, and Russian R
 iver fun!\n\nTHE PROGRAM SHOWCASES THE BEST OF BAY AREA CINEMA\n\nRRFF wil
 l showcase narrative features\, documentaries\, shorts\, student work\, an
 d emerging voices from the Bay Area and beyond. This year’s Festival lin
 eup includes more than 20 films that reflect the creativity and range of t
 he North Bay and Bay Area\, with filmmakers and artists represented from M
 onte Rio\, Occidental\, Forestville\, Santa Rosa\, Sebastopol\, Sea Ranch\
 , San Francisco\, Oakland\, and beyond.  \n\nMany of our films have rece
 ntly screened at prestigious festivals including Tribeca Film Festival\, S
 F International Film Festival\, FRAMELINE LGBTQ\\+ Film Festival and many 
 more.\n\nOUR FILM FESTIVAL IS UNIQUE\n\nFestival events center around the 
 historic Monte Rio Theater and nearby venues\, creating an intimate small
 ‑town setting where filmmakers and audiences actually meet\, talk\, and 
 connect.\n\nWhether you’re an industry professional\, an aspiring filmma
 ker\, or simply someone who loves discovering new stories on the big scree
 n\, River & Redwoods offers a welcoming space to experience films in commu
 nity.\n\nGET TICKETS AND MORE FESTIVAL INFORMATION\n\n\\>\\> Festival Tick
 ets are now on sale! Get your tickets on our Festival Eventbrite page http
 s://riverandredwoodsfilmfest2026.eventbrite.com\n\n\\>\\> For more informa
 tion about the River \\+ Redwoods Film Festival and program\, head to http
 s://www.riverandredwoodsfilmfestival.com/home\n\n\\>\\> Join us on Instagr
 am for offers\, filmmaker interviews\, and the latest festival news @RIVER
 REDWOODSFILMFESTIVAL\n\n\\>\\> For Volunteer Opportunities\, Sponsorship O
 pportunities and Accessibility Inquiries contact us at info@riverandredwoo
 dsfilmfestival.com
LOCATION:Monte Rio Theater and Extravaganza
URL:https://www.riverandredwoodsfilmfestival.com/home
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
