DESCRIPTION:Calling antique and collectible lovers! Browse and shop the 40
 th Annual Petaluma Antique Faire\, set in beautiful\, relaxing Historic Do
 wntown Petaluma. \n\nHistoric Downtown Petaluma is "The Bay Area's Premie
 r Antique Center\," and transforms into an antique marketplace twice a yea
 r. Amid the beautiful historic buildings\, one-of-a-kind stores\, restaura
 nts and cafes\, you’ll find an incomparable selection of affordable anti
 ques from 200\\+ dealers. The show boasts a variety of estate jewelry\, li
 nens\, furniture\, art\, kitchenware\, vintage décor\, books\, and all ki
 nds of unusual collectibles to suit everyone's budget.\n\nMore than 8\,000
  discerning collectors and first-time buyers wishing to collect and invest
  in real antiques find treasures at Petaluma’s Fall Antique Faire. This 
 free fair spans Kentucky Street\, Fourth Street\, the A Street parking lot
 \, and Western Avenue.
LOCATION:Historic Downtown Petaluma
