 astopol.\n\nThen\, enjoy a side-by-side tasting of four to five hand-picke
 d heirloom apples\, paired with local artisan cheeses drizzled with our ap
 ple cider syrup and a taste of freshly pressed apple juice.\n\nThis is a l
