BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:ILLEAGLES - The Premier Tribute to the Music of the Eagles
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261003T200000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261003T200000
UID:260822AevXdscew0GqZJGt7CtTKA
DESCRIPTION:Date: Saturday\, October 3\, 2026\n\nTime: Doors 6 PM | Show
  8 PM\n\nTickets: $35\n\nFood Vendor: TBA\n\nWhat do people want when the
 y go see a live band? The members of SF Bay Area based tribute band ILLEAG
 LES believe that everyone in the crowd wants to be engaged and captivated 
 from the first note until the show is done. Over the past year and a half 
 of sold out performances\, that is exactly what every crowd has gotten.\n\
 nILLEAGLES was founded in late 2016 when 6 friends came together who all h
 ad 2 things in common: 1\\) they loved the music of the Eagles\, and 2\\) 
 each member was an amazing musician in their own right. This common vision
  led to hours and hours of studying\, rehearsing\, and mastering each of t
 he Eagles classic hits.\n\nFrom rockers Life in the Fast Lane and Heartach
 e Tonight\, to swooning ballads Desperado and Best of My Love\, ILLEAGLES 
 not only reproduce the soaring guitars\, multi-part harmonies and tightnes
 s of the original band\, but also add their own brand of swagger and energ
 y that keeps fans coming back over and over. It's commonplace for a majori
 ty of the audience to start singing along on the first song\, and continui
 ng to sing until the show is over \\(or they lose their voices\\).\n\nILLE
 AGLES- A high energy\, unforgettable party that leaves fans wanting more..
 .
LOCATION:Coyote Sonoma
URL:https://shop.coyotesonoma.com/illeagles-103-p248.aspx
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Tales of Suspense - 3 Classic Radio Dramas Live on Stage
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261003T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261003T213000
UID:260821XXfsxCwtTk2xBfdkq3PlPA
DESCRIPTION:Step back into the Golden Age of Radio as Cloverdale Performin
 g Arts Center presents three unforgettable tales of mystery and suspense\,
  performed live with voice actors\, sound effects\, and music created befo
 re your eyes.\n\nThe Monkey's Paw tells the chilling story of a mysterious
  talisman that grants three wishes—but at a terrible cost. A timeless su
 pernatural thriller that reminds us to be careful what we wish for.\n\nThe
  House in Cypress Canyon follows a newlywed couple whose dream home become
 s the setting for an unexplainable and terrifying mystery. As strange even
 ts unfold\, the line between reality and nightmare begins to blur.\n\nThe 
 Maltese Falcon\, adapted from the classic detective story\, plunges audien
 ces into a world of deception\, danger\, and intrigue as private investiga
 tor Sam Spade searches for a priceless treasure while navigating a web of 
 unforgettable characters.\n\nJoin us for an evening of classic radio drama
  where every sound sparks the imagination and every story keeps you on the
  edge of your seat.
LOCATION:Cloverdale Performing Arts Center
URL:https://www.cloverdaleperformingarts.com/events/tales-of-expense-3-cla
 ssic-radio-dramas-live-on-stage
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
