DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261003T190000
UID:260820UG3L_10S6EWRsZFwzpmiCg
DESCRIPTION:Formed in Columbus\, OH in Spring 2016\, The Quasi Kings are q
 uickly gaining momentum in the Ohio and Midwest reggae scenes. Their uniqu
 e blend of roots reggae and modern styles puts an emphasis on songwriting 
 and vocal harmonies and has lead to their opening for the likes of Rebelut
 ion\, Badfish\, Fortunate Youth\, Passafire\, The Expanders\, Third World\
 , GPGD\, The Werks\, Tropidelic\, and more. With a high energy stage show 
 and an ever growing performance schedule\, 2024 looks to be a big year for
  The Quasi Kings!\n\nMore info at thequasikings.com
LOCATION:Mystic Theatre & Music Hall
URL:https://www.bandsintown.com/e/108577034?app_id=pkvts0on0m&came_from=28
 7&utm_medium=api&utm_source=partner_api&utm_campaign=event
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
