DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261004T190000
UID:260802FNMgCKHW8EW8dZm-c-L8jw
DESCRIPTION:  \n\nAt Gundlach Bundschu\, we’ve always believed that the
  best memories happen after the bottle is opened. This October\, we’re b
 ringing that spirit to life in a new way – and you’re officially invit
 ed! \n\nJoin us on Sunday October 4th for the inaugural Soundcheck\, a bra
 nd-new daytime live music event. For one afternoon\, we’re transforming 
 the Rhinefarm into an immersive concert experience\, with live music at ou
 r Amphitheater stage\, DJ sets\, local food trucks\, wine tasting experien
 ces\, and plenty to discover between performances. \n\nThis year’s conce
 rt will feature Tropa Magica\, along with a few more independent artists t
 o be announced soon. Soundcheck is all about discovering new music in an u
 nforgettable setting – and you may just leave with a new favorite band
 … \n\nReserve your spot today and help us kick off what we hope becomes 
 a favorite tradition for years to come. \n\nDATE: Sunday October 4th\, 202
 6 \n\nTIME: 2-7p \n\nLOCATION: Gundlach Bundschu Winery \\(Amphitheater\, 
 Courtyard & Arbor Bar\\) \n\nTICKETS: Gundlach Bundschu or Abbot’s Passa
 ge Club member price $35. Additional non-member guests are $55pp and very 
 limited. Guests under 10 are free to attend. \n\nBUY TICKETS
LOCATION:Gundlach Bundschu Winery
URL:https://www.gunbun.com/event/bacchus-club-soundcheck-concert/
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
