DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261004T170000
UID:260701SNSjGffPJ0OEGfyZV0C6RA
DESCRIPTION:Numbers. Prizes. Elevated Vibes.\n\nStep into a high-energy tw
 ist on a classic favorite inside The Lounge at Mercy.\n\nThis isn’t your
  average bingo. This is bingo—elevated. Cards in hand. Smoke in the air.
  Energy in the room.\n\nPlay through multiple bingo rounds throughout the 
 day\, compete\, and stay locked into an experience that blends cannabis cu
 lture with interactive gameplay from start to finish.\n\nYour ticket inclu
 des access to all bingo sessions\, brand tastings\, exclusive product drop
 s\, and additional games and activations happening across the space.\n\nOn
 e game. All day. Let the numbers hit.\n\nThis is a 420-friendly interactiv
 e experience hosted inside our fully licensed cannabis consumption lounge\
 , where guests can enjoy responsibly while participating in gameplay\, tas
 tings\, and activations. Bingo hits different here.\n\nTime: 12:00 PM - 5:
 00 PM\n\n$25 — General Admission: Entry to Bingo Smokeout 🎱 Includes 
 access to all bingo rounds and brand tastings\, as well as an infused cock
 tail and a gram of flower to get the party started. \n\n🔥 $100 — Cou
 ch Crew Pass \\(3 Guests\\): Entry to Bingo Smokeout 🎱 Includes access 
 to all bingo rounds and brand tastings\, as well as an infused cocktail an
 d a gram of flower to get the party started. \n\n21\\+ Only | DCC \\# C12
 -0000420-LIC\n\nEvent Terms & Conditions\n\nThis event is 21\\+ only. Vali
 d government-issued ID is required for entry. By attending this event at t
 he Mercy Wellness Lounge\, you acknowledge that photography and video reco
 rding may take place. Images and footage may be used by Mercy Wellness for
  marketing and promotional purposes across various channels\, without comp
 ensation. Tickets are non-refundable unless otherwise stated. Event detail
 s\, timing\, or programming are subject to change.\n\nCannabis consumption
  is limited to designated areas and must comply with all applicable local 
 and state regulations. Please consume responsibly.\n\nBy entering the venu
 e\, you agree to comply with all house rules and venue policies.
LOCATION:The Lounge at Mercy
URL:https://mercywellness.com/mercy-bingo-game-nights
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Summer Collectors Lunch Pairing at Lynmar Estate
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261004T123000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261004T143000
UID:260626DNkQ23f2IE6VgqBlEy30SQ
DESCRIPTION:Rooted in the bounty of Quail Hill Vineyard\, Lynmar Estate’
 s Summer Collectors Lunch Pairing invites guests to experience the flavors
  of Sonoma County at their seasonal peak. The elevated four-course menu sh
 owcases ingredients harvested from Lynmar’s organically farmed gardens\,
  orchards\, and olive groves. Each course is individually plated and thoug
 htfully paired with Lynmar’s acclaimed estate-grown Pinot Noirs\, Chardo
 nnays\, and sparkling wines\, creating a journey that is both deeply conne
 cted to Sonoma County and globally inspired. Served in the idyllic setting
  of Quail Hill Vineyard\, the experience is further enhanced by a special 
 tableside visit from Estate Chef David Frakes.\n\nCollectors Lunch Pairing
  Menu Summer 2026:\n\nAdam’s Vineyard Chardonnay\, 2022\n\nWarm Organic 
 Popcorn\n\n*White Corn-Kasundi Salt\, Estate Extra-Virgin Olive Oil*\n\nSu
 sanna’s Vineyard Chardonnay\, 2022\n\nThai Green Curry & Coconut Soup\n\
 n*Bliss Snap Peas & Heirloom Radish*\n\nYoung Vines Pinot Noir\, 2021\n\nH
 eirloom Potato & Cherry Tomato ‘Croustade’\n\n*Smoked Bacon-Grain Must
 ard Dressing*\n\nSusanna’s Vineyard Pinot Noir\, 2022\n\nRoasted Syrian 
 Seven-Spiced Chicken Breast\n\n*Indonesian Corn Fritter\, Summer Vegetable
  Ragout\, Balado Sauce*\n\nRosé de Blancs Sparkling\, 2021\n\nChilled Van
 illa Burnt Basque Cheesecake\n\n*Raspberry-Rose Syrup\, Black Tea & Licori
 ce-Poached Cherries*\n\n*Brown Butter Nilla Cookie\, Candied Lime*\n\n**Es
 tate Ingredients:**\n\nBay Laurel\, Cherries\, Chives\, Edible Flowers\, L
 emons\, Olive Oil\, Peas\, Potatoes\, Radishes\, Raspberries\, Thyme\, Tom
 atoes\, Zucchini and more!\n\nMenu by Estate Chef David Frakes\n\nReservat
 ions are required. Maximum group size is six guests.
LOCATION:Lynmar Estate 
URL:https://lynmarestate.com/reservation/type/collectors-lunch-pairing/ 
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
