DESCRIPTION:Shifting Perspectives Debra Seal Slough City Gallery proudly p
 resents Shifting Perspectives by Debra Seal. In Shifting Perspectives\, De
 bra Seal continues to play with the shapes of the body to create unexpecte
 d patterns. She looks at skin and form in a way that feels more like a rhy
 thmic design than just a person.By finding the humor and tenderness in the
 se shapes\, she celebrates the beauty of being human. This show will be up
  through the month of February. Gallery hours are Wednesday-Saturday 10-6 
 and Sundays 10-4. Opening Reception: Saturday\, February 7th\, 5-8pm
LOCATION:D
