BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Summer Film Series at The Madrona
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261007T203000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261007T210000
UID:2606257jw3I10JDk-cUoh-_T5NkQ
DESCRIPTION:The Summer Film Series at The Madrona is a thoughtfully curate
 d outdoor program in partnership with True West Film Center and a rotating
  roster of local wine partners. The experience kicked off in May and conti
 nues on the first Wednesday of each month through October**\,** transformi
 ng the hotel’s eight-acre hillside estate into an open-air cinema set ag
 ainst sweeping Sonoma views.\n\nEach evening begins at golden hour\, with 
 guests invited to settle into the lawn with a glass of local wine\, surrou
 nded by lush gardens and the historic 1881 estate. Tickets are available o
 n OpenTable for $61.20 per person and include event admission\, popcorn an
 d a snack\, a complimentary glass of wine from a winery partner\, personal
  headphones\, and cozy blankets and seating tufts designed by Northern Cal
 ifornian designer Erica Tavov.\n\nThe 2026 lineup leans into iconic\, feel
 -good films that complement the nostalgic ease of summer evenings with the
  future showings listed below:\n\n·       **July 1** – A League o
 f Their Own\n\n·       **August 5** – Back to the Future\n\n· 
       **September 2** – Clueless\n\n·       **October 7** 
 – Audience Choice: E.T.\, Zombieland\, or Death Becomes Her
LOCATION:The Madrona
URL:https://themadronahotel.com/summer-film-series/
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:A Taste of Italy at Centennial Mountain Tasting Room
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261007T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261007T170000
UID:260430s_OJ0HhPbUyWUgHoRpg3OA
DESCRIPTION:For wine drinkers eager to experience world-class wines made i
 n California from Italian varieties\, the Centennial Mountain Tasting Room
  is a must during any trip to Sonoma County. Located just off the plaza in
  the charming town of Healdsburg near famed restaurants\, boutiques and ga
 lleries\, the Centennial Mountain Tasting Room is a destination that invit
 es discovery. Founded by the acclaimed team that guides renowned Pinot Noi
 r and Chardonnay producer Rhys Vineyards\, Centennial Mountain was establi
 shed to explore Italian grape varieties grown on its acclaimed Centennial 
 Mountain Vineyard in the rugged mountains of Northern Sonoma County.\n\nTh
 e Centennial Mountain Vineyard Tasting features the winery’s coveted Neb
 biolo\, and the pioneering Carricante and Nerello Mascalese wines\, among 
 others. To showcase how beautifully the wines pair with food\, the winery 
 also offers a delicious Wine and Sushi Pairing from nearby Asahi Sushi\, o
 ne of Healdsburg’s most popular dining destinations.\n\nGuests can also 
 enhance their tasting experience with a curated salumi board from Journeym
 an Meat Company. This generous accompaniment features six house-made salum
 i\, crostini\, cornichons\, olives\, and a selection of local cheese that 
 serves 2 to 5 guests.
LOCATION:Centennial Mountain Tasting Room
URL:https://cmvineyard.com/visit/
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
